Comment: 0,0:01:15.06,0:01:17.60,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:12.95,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 5,0:00:12.00,0:00:12.78,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,There we go.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:16.02,0:00:18.16,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, did that one break too?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:19.42,0:00:21.83,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if we could buy new ones...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:23.48,0:00:25.50,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be fine if I can just fix them.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:25.87,0:00:28.33,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like they need to be new to work well.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:30.30,0:00:32.08,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,How is college going?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,How is? I mean...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.66,0:00:37.56,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You're going when you're supposed to, right? You're getting all your credits?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:38.34,0:00:39.70,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Of course.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:39.70,0:00:40.99,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,That's good.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:42.03,0:00:45.53,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,You're always working so hard here...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:47.85,0:00:49.53,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Morning, Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.53,0:00:51.86,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morni{\fscx200}-{\fscx100} Ahhh!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.86,0:00:53.72,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato fell again!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:53.72,0:00:55.46,Default,Kid 2,0000,0000,0000,,You're so clumsy!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:55.46,0:00:57.72,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right, Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:56.57,0:00:57.53,Default Alt,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.72,0:01:00.87,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you keep tripping when there's nothing to trip over?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.28,0:01:05.99,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:07.47,0:01:09.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! Thank you...
Dialogue: 5,0:02:48.15,0:02:49.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:50.98,0:02:54.27,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll help you! Please let me help out!
Dialogue: 5,0:02:55.13,0:02:56.40,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Do as you like.
Dialogue: 5,0:02:57.51,0:02:58.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:04.93,0:03:06.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:08.40,0:03:11.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There's something I wanted to ask you...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:13.69,0:03:14.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:15.00,0:03:19.10,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Be quiet and keep painting. If you have time to talk, then you're not working hard enough.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.54,0:03:20.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.77,0:03:24.57,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What is it.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:24.57,0:03:25.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:25.81,0:03:28.18,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I'm asking you what it is you wanted to ask me.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:28.18,0:03:29.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:30.29,0:03:35.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, it's about the strange\Ntelephone call from the other day.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:37.42,0:03:40.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't we tell Miss Sayaka about it?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:42.03,0:03:43.37,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,We just can't right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:43.93,0:03:46.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why can't we?
Dialogue: 5,0:03:47.56,0:03:50.41,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you can't keep quiet about it,\Nthen you can just stop coming here.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:53.71,0:03:57.38,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell her, it'll make things difficult for her. That's why.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.67,0:04:00.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Difficult? For Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.26,0:04:19.28,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to help or trying to get in the way?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:26.19,0:04:27.95,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter, Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:29.41,0:04:32.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I made Fujimoto angry again!
Dialogue: 5,0:04:32.83,0:04:34.31,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,You did?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:34.31,0:04:39.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. I kept getting in the way of his work.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:40.60,0:04:43.37,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine if you just apologize to him, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:43.37,0:04:45.30,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,We'll come with you!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.40,0:05:05.65,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he only got angry because he was worried about you, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:05.65,0:05:07.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.03,0:05:09.92,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Really! Don't be sad!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:09.92,0:05:13.50,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mama always tells me, I want you to grow up well, that's why I get angry with you!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:14.04,0:05:15.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I see!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:15.71,0:05:19.70,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll apologize to him then ask him if he'll let me help out again!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.02,0:05:22.71,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:22.93,0:05:24.04,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,He's not here.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:29.64,0:05:31.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what this is.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:32.35,0:05:35.98,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,This? It must be Fujimoto's report.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.21,0:05:37.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Report?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:37.49,0:05:40.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if he needs it today...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.69,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, do you mind delivering it to him?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:42.69,0:05:44.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Me?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:44.90,0:05:47.19,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he's looking for it.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:47.19,0:05:49.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring it to him!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:54.54,0:05:57.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's up. You're awfully excited.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:57.48,0:06:03.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't always be getting in the\Nway, I need to try and be helpful!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:04.92,0:06:10.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's college... is this way, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:10.19,0:06:12.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You did get directions before leaving, didn't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:12.64,0:06:16.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! But what's "college"?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.24,0:06:19.65,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You came all this way\Nwithout even knowing that?!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.17,0:06:24.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't say your lack of common sense really surprises me anymore.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.86,0:06:28.90,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,College is a place where you study all sorts of difficult things.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.90,0:06:30.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Study?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.35,0:06:34.91,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,When there's something you want to do,\Nor some job you're looking to get, y'know?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:34.91,0:06:36.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Something you want to do...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.28,0:06:44.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are... There are so many people!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.98,0:06:47.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's a college. Makes sense that it would have this many people.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.85,0:06:51.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder how many times bigger it is compared to Yomogi Nursery...
Dialogue: 5,0:06:51.64,0:06:52.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They're not comparable!!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:56.26,0:06:58.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up and go find him!
Dialogue: 5,0:06:58.11,0:06:59.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:02.62,0:07:03.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:07.50,0:07:08.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.25,0:07:15.28,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.82,0:07:14.97,Default,Football team,0000,0000,0000,,One two, one two!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:17.28,0:07:20.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse... me?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.23,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get lost!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:24.78,0:07:27.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't find him...
Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.75,0:07:31.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You just wandered aimlessly around campus!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep trying!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:37.93,0:07:39.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:45.15,0:07:46.83,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you just standing there?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:49.24,0:07:52.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's right, I need to deliver this!
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.41,0:07:56.68,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't trip now!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:02.18,0:08:04.07,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:04.66,0:08:05.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:07.32,0:08:09.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.17,0:08:11.08,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:11.55,0:08:13.97,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What a cute stuffed animal. Here you go.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:14.56,0:08:16.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:16.55,0:08:17.79,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,And this is...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.81,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Are you... Kiyokazu's friend?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.06,0:08:24.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No! I mean... I'm not really his friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.38,0:08:26.62,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Something close to a friend then?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:26.62,0:08:28.88,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Probably...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.82,0:08:30.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Me too.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:31.55,0:08:32.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You are?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:33.57,0:08:36.41,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Takashi Domoto. And you?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.64,0:08:39.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato! It's nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:39.47,0:08:42.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I came to bring that to Fujimoto.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.91,0:08:44.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:08:46.86,0:08:49.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He was just here...
Dialogue: 5,0:08:49.89,0:08:51.56,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like he ran away.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:52.65,0:08:55.89,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,You see, I kind of made him angry earlier.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:55.89,0:08:57.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Angry again?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:57.59,0:08:58.51,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.51,0:09:01.09,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto gets angry very easily.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.09,0:09:06.44,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But! That's because I keep messing up...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.98,0:09:09.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But! I think he gets angry a little too often...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:09.71,0:09:16.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But... it's always because of\Nme, it's not Fujimoto's fault...
Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.53,0:09:23.08,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I see! Yomogi Nursery, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:23.08,0:09:25.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'm helping out there.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:26.42,0:09:30.14,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,All right, let's go find Kiyokazu together, Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:30.14,0:09:32.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Find Fujimoto together? Is that okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:33.37,0:09:34.94,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Would I be in the way?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, no, not at all! That would help me out a lot!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.40,0:09:39.49,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Great.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:58.08,0:10:01.90,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Around this time... he's probably in Jurisprudence.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.58,0:10:05.91,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I think he's\Naround campus all day today.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:07.17,0:10:09.29,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,He should be cutting back on part-time hours.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:09.29,0:10:10.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.28,0:10:12.76,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost exam time after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:13.08,0:10:17.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's always so busy.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:17.34,0:10:18.51,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,He is, isn't he?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:19.68,0:10:24.42,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,He takes so many classes, but still puts work first.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:25.19,0:10:28.18,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's just like Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.99,0:10:32.10,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto! Do us a favor!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.10,0:10:32.86,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,What's up?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:32.86,0:10:34.63,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We were wondering if you could help us.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:34.63,0:10:38.32,Default,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,We have no idea where to start from on Professor Hayakawa's report.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:38.99,0:10:41.55,Default,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't it suck that it's due next week?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:41.55,0:10:43.83,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I got it, I got it. I'll help.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:43.83,0:10:44.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:44.71,0:10:46.45,Default,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Domoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:46.45,0:10:50.74,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Just to let you know, I'll help, but you'll be doing the work.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:50.74,0:10:52.04,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We know!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:52.37,0:10:53.38,Default,Girl 2,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.15,0:10:55.42,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Man...
Dialogue: 5,0:10:56.71,0:10:57.92,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, let's go.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.02,0:11:01.50,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? Haven't seen him.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.07,0:11:03.57,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe he's in the library?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:04.03,0:11:05.22,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:05.22,0:11:09.41,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,If you do see him, can you tell him that I'm looking for him?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:09.94,0:11:10.73,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,No can do!
Dialogue: 5,0:11:11.39,0:11:14.52,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,That guy just doesn't get along with people. He's kinda scary.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:14.52,0:11:16.03,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:16.03,0:11:17.80,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.62,0:11:25.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone afraid of Fujimoto?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.29,0:11:32.13,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, he's not too friendly, and he always looks like he's angry about something.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:32.13,0:11:33.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think he's scary too?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:34.34,0:11:37.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You said before that you made him angry...
Dialogue: 5,0:11:38.89,0:11:42.13,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu has reason to be angry.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:43.11,0:11:46.84,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,He's always been the type who doesn't take help from anyone,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:47.84,0:11:52.46,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,but I tried to give him advice about the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:53.58,0:11:57.73,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I've always known that he was like that, but I still opened my mouth.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:58.20,0:11:59.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.51,0:12:06.19,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess it was because I just couldn't leave him alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:08.15,0:12:10.04,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.04,0:12:11.25,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:11.25,0:12:14.88,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone's waiting! Hurry up and come play.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:15.32,0:12:21.26,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. Neither Fujimoto nor Kobato\Nare here today, you guys must be bored.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:22.14,0:12:23.76,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Not really...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:25.35,0:12:27.44,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Wait just a bit longer, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:27.44,0:12:29.06,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.53,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,You have a visitor!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:32.97,0:12:34.94,Default,Chii,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:34.94,0:12:37.56,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,It's Chiho and Chise!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:38.55,0:12:41.32,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Chitose... What's the matter?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:41.32,0:12:42.32,Default,Chiho/Chise,0000,0000,0000,,You see...
Dialogue: 5,0:12:42.69,0:12:45.41,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,We made macarons with Mom!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:45.41,0:12:47.84,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,And we wanted to share them with everyone!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.14,Default,Chiho/Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.85,0:12:53.12,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.36,0:12:54.73,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Yummy!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:54.73,0:12:56.12,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,It's so crispy!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.28,0:13:00.46,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, where are Kiyokazu and Kobato?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:00.78,0:13:03.76,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,The two of them are off at college today.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.85,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato too?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.31,0:13:09.60,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto? He just left.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:10.05,0:13:13.89,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I see. Thank you. I'll look around.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:14.20,0:13:15.66,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Wait up, Domoto.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:16.80,0:13:19.15,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,You're close with Professor Tomita, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.73,0:13:23.70,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,If I can't get credit this year, I'm in trouble. Could you say something to him for me?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:24.08,0:13:25.53,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Have you spoken to him yourself?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:25.53,0:13:28.02,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Ah... It's kind of awkward...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:28.02,0:13:31.73,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,If someone he likes, like you, could put in a good word for me first...
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.49,0:13:34.45,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,All right. I'll do it.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:34.45,0:13:36.67,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I owe you!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:37.00,0:13:38.69,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Talk to the Professor yourself too, got it?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.69,0:13:39.01,Default,Student,0000,0000,0000,,{\alpha&HFF&}blank\Nblank
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.69,0:13:41.71,Default Alt,Student,0000,0000,0000,,Got it! See you later!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.01,0:13:43.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone really counts on\NDomoto, don't they, Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.50,0:13:46.54,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.80,0:13:47.99,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:47.99,0:13:49.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:50.56,0:13:52.44,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Would you mind if we took a little detour?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.44,0:13:53.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 5,0:13:56.56,0:14:00.81,Default,Professor,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you put it like that, his grades are just...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:01.16,0:14:03.15,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,He's really upset about the whole thing...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:03.55,0:14:06.44,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Please, Professor Tomita. If\Nthere's anything you could do.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.65,0:14:11.39,Default,Professor,0000,0000,0000,,All right, fine. Since you're the one who's asking.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:11.39,0:14:12.46,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.08,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:18.08,0:14:20.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:20.22,0:14:21.02,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.50,0:14:22.30,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,At what?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:22.67,0:14:27.65,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,To have so many people count on you, and to be able to help so many people.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:27.65,0:14:28.71,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.15,0:14:36.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely! I wish I could help everyone,\Nbut I just can't seem to get the hang of it...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:36.28,0:14:38.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're amazing!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.54,0:14:43.02,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know if I should say thank you for that or not...
Dialogue: 5,0:14:45.03,0:14:48.25,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, it's nothing. Shall we go?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.25,0:14:49.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:50.53,0:14:52.41,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Rock, paper, scissor, shoot!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:52.84,0:14:54.94,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I lost!
Dialogue: 5,0:14:55.33,0:14:59.42,Default,Chise,0000,0000,0000,,Then Chiho's it! Come on everybody, let's go hide!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:02.46,0:15:05.31,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,One... two...
Dialogue: 5,0:15:06.25,0:15:09.05,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I see! That's why she went to college.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:09.45,0:15:12.44,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,She seemed very excited about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:12.44,0:15:14.29,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,That's Kobato for you, no?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:16.05,0:15:18.37,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, will you take a look at this?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:20.92,0:15:22.06,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,Yukari.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:23.54,0:15:24.61,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Chise?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:26.47,0:15:28.24,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right...?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:30.54,0:15:33.23,Default,Chiho,0000,0000,0000,,I got you, Yukari!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.23,0:15:35.27,Default,Yukari,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, you're Chiho!
Dialogue: 5,0:15:35.96,0:15:40.60,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,This is something that might help you\Nout if you're thinking of getting a loan.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:41.29,0:15:43.67,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,And this one's from an accountant friend of mine.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:43.95,0:15:45.49,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,And this one{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 5,0:15:45.91,0:15:47.43,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Chitose.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.96,0:15:51.01,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka, do you understand?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:52.25,0:15:56.62,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not helping you out of pity.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:56.97,0:16:02.56,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,I want to help protect the Yomogi\NNursery that me, Chiho, and Chise went to.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:03.14,0:16:06.11,Default,Chitose,0000,0000,0000,,So you don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:08.66,0:16:09.62,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.21,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Finally found him.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:17.22,0:16:18.51,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:19.05,0:16:23.65,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You guys cut class, didn't you? I don't like helping people who do that.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:23.65,0:16:27.44,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't like helping people, why don't you just say so!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.44,0:16:29.30,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I don't. I refuse.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.97,0:16:31.30,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Fine! Forget it!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.34,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,We shouldn't have asked\Nsomeone like him anyway!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:39.80,0:16:41.44,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:42.16,0:16:43.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You're so mean!
Dialogue: 5,0:16:44.10,0:16:45.26,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,About what?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:45.26,0:16:51.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You didn't need to say that in a way that would make people angry, did you?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.49,0:16:54.06,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,If I didn't, they'd just keep asking.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.06,0:16:56.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Those girls might've had a reason for skipping.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:56.80,0:17:00.96,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't matter. Your business, take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:02.87,0:17:05.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Here! You forgot this. I brought it for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:12.39,0:17:13.08,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 5,0:17:20.99,0:17:24.43,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't believe I said that...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.12,0:17:28.00,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:29.56,0:17:30.73,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:31.26,0:17:36.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I forgot to thank you for\Nhelping me look for Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:17:36.85,0:17:39.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:39.11,0:17:40.81,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Sit, sit.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:45.06,0:17:48.32,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,When did you meet Kiyokazu?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.69,0:17:52.34,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, spring of this year.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.70,0:17:53.70,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:54.46,0:17:55.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,How come?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.64,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I just felt jealous.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:59.66,0:18:01.43,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Of you and Kiyokazu.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:01.81,0:18:04.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto and... I?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:05.73,0:18:09.14,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I've known Kiyokazu for\Nmuch longer than you have,
Dialogue: 5,0:18:09.54,0:18:12.97,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,but I still can't speak to him the way you just did.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:13.30,0:18:20.28,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I really offended him, didn't I?\NI said such disrespectful things...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.28,0:18:25.27,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,No, what you said was right.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:26.00,0:18:29.58,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that I can't say the right thing.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:31.66,0:18:34.52,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. I'm asking for too much.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:34.52,0:18:38.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many wonderful things about you!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:38.76,0:18:40.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Like how you're so nice.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:41.04,0:18:42.72,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not nice.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:42.94,0:18:47.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? But you listen to everyone's requests and help them out!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:47.50,0:18:48.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's very nice of you.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:49.18,0:18:53.06,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, that's because I'm bad at refusing.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:53.06,0:18:58.58,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,If I really wanted to help them out, I should refuse like Kiyokazu does.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:00.92,0:19:06.04,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You guys cut class, didn't you? I don't like helping people who do that.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.69,0:19:12.04,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Kiyokazu's not afraid of people\Nhating him. He's a strong person.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:13.05,0:19:15.00,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,The reason people are afraid to get close to him
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.00,0:19:17.75,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,is probably because they're\Noverpowered by his strength.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:18.72,0:19:21.94,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm jealous of his strength.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.24,0:19:25.89,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Jealous of... his strength?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.98,0:19:28.71,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.02,0:19:40.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know Fujimoto very well,\Nbut being feared makes you lonely.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:41.39,0:19:43.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Being hated is painful.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:45.52,0:19:51.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone we met today looked so happy\Nwhen you said that you would help them.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.78,0:19:52.78,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,But that's{\fscx200}-{\fscx100}
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.78,0:19:54.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.84,0:19:58.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is not wanting to be hated a bad thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.13,0:20:02.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is wanting to be liked a bad thing?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:03.21,0:20:06.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it bad to try and help people?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:06.93,0:20:11.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is it wrong to want to help people who are troubled?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.47,0:20:18.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't explain it very well, but you're a good person.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:25.78,0:20:26.55,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:29.58,0:20:31.46,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,You're a strange girl, aren't you.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.41,0:20:36.17,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! I said something strange, didn't I?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:36.17,0:20:40.66,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I always make Ioryogi angry\Nbecause I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:40.66,0:20:41.78,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:42.47,0:20:46.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Ioryogi's a stuffed animal, but he can speak!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:46.40,0:20:49.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Even though he can speak, you can't speak to him!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.38,0:20:52.46,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Is that stuffed animal Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.46,0:20:53.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:53.46,0:20:54.60,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Domoto!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.38,0:20:56.57,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The girls from earlier!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:57.54,0:20:58.63,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I'm off.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:58.97,0:21:01.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:02.21,0:21:04.32,Default,Takashi,0000,0000,0000,,You too. See you later.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:04.55,0:21:05.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,See you!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:09.34,0:21:11.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Why did the konpeito...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:12.44,0:21:17.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Because you acknowledged\Nthat attractive guy's kindness.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.36,0:21:21.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Attractive guy? Domoto?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:21.07,0:21:22.41,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Was there anyone else?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:22.41,0:21:25.84,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But, but, just by acknowledging his\Nkindness, I gained another konpeito?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:25.84,0:21:30.41,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No matter what others think, everyone has things that they're worried about.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:30.41,0:21:32.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:32.58,0:21:36.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess attractive guys have\Nattractive guy worries as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:38.32,0:21:40.14,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Dobato.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.14,0:21:42.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,About this afternoon...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.64,0:21:47.20,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you tell him about me?!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:47.20,0:21:51.20,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But I did just as you said and didn't talk to you, Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.77,0:21:56.06,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,No one would believe that a stuffed animal can speak!!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:56.06,0:21:58.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.46,0:22:01.25,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! 30 points!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:01.25,0:22:05.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What! No!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.44,0:22:08.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:09.34,0:22:11.29,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,I said you were helpful.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:15.55,0:22:18.39,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, Fujimoto. Still the same as always.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:20.01,0:22:25.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He's just awkward. That was him trying his hardest to thank you.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.49,0:22:26.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank... me?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.40,0:22:31.45,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! Mr. Kiyokazu's not angry anymore, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:22:31.45,0:22:34.87,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,He's not scary. Mr. Kiyokazu's nice, see.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:35.85,0:22:40.89,Default,Marina,0000,0000,0000,,He's nice! When I lost the key to my house, he found it for me!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.89,0:22:42.90,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He made a bamboo-copter for me!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:42.90,0:22:45.63,Default,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,He gave me cicada shells!
Dialogue: 5,0:22:46.02,0:22:47.59,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,He's not a bad kid.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.57,0:22:56.08,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto... He's such\Na strange person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.56,0:00:06.31,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord2\fnHarrowprint\c&HBAC4C8&\3c&H232C32&\pos(111,447)}Yomogi\NNursery
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.85,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\fs40\b1\c&H282D4D&\fnHarrowprint\pos(359,211)}N               O
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.85,Signs,Sign,0000,0000,0000,,{\b1\fnHarrowprint\c&H2E4C36&\pos(483,328)}Wet paint,\Ndon't touch!
